{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a0b339d81eb22542","name":"Limpet Mine","source":{"id":"source:reference-a0b339d81eb22542","title":"Limpet Mine","revision":20892,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:43:56Z","sha256":"f97b6e527751a1eb8e7c8e4d1737e8eb37c6b7bbc7f50727b8c66445e55165cc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20892","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Limpet%20Mine&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a0b339d81eb22542","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 300\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed to take out tanks and other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", Limpet Mines are flat and about the size of a dinner plate. One side of the Mine has a handle for easy gripping, and the other side is covered with microbeads of adhesive that break on hard contact with a flat surface (such as the side of a tank), ensuring solid adhesion. The shaped charge of the Limpet Mine causes negligible damage beyond its 1-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius, and ignores the DR of the object or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," it is attached to. Activating a Limpet Mine is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},". The detonation is delayed for one round, providing opportunity to move away before the Limpet Mine explodes. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," that are Large or larger offer sufficient surface area for attaching a Limpet Mine, but the Mines cannot be used on characters or smaller ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Mines are designed for placement in the ground or to be otherwise hidden from sight. Any character attempting to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Notice"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Notice"}," a Mine takes a -5 penalty to his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check. Setting a Mine is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," and does not require a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. However, attaching a detonator (either Timed or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Manual_Trigger","referenceId":"reference:3bac33a88449a688"},") requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check and overrides the Mine's built-in triggering system.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 6d6 (Energy)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Radius:"]}," 1-Square (",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"},")\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
